er-1768961866723{\nmargin-top: 0px;\nmargin-right: 0px;\nmargin-bottom: 30px;\nmargin-left: 0px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 1199.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866723{margin-top: 0px;\nmargin-right: 0px;\nmargin-bottom: 30px;\nmargin-left: 0px;}}\n@media (max-width: 991.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866723{margin-top: 0px;\nmargin-right: 0px;\nmargin-bottom: 30px;\nmargin-left: 0px;}}\n@media (max-width: 767.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866723{}}\n@media (max-width: 575.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866723{}}#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .sppb-addon-title{\n}</style><style type=\"text/css\">#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .sppb-addon-sppb-flibox{\ntext-align: center;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .sppb-flipbox-panel,#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .threeD-item{\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .sppb-flipbox-front,#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .threeD-flip-front{\ncolor: #fff;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .threeD-flip-front:before,#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .sppb-flipbox-front.flip-box:before{\nbackground-color: #051646;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .sppb-flipbox-back,#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .threeD-flip-back{\ncolor: #fff;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .threeD-flip-back:before,#sppb-addon-1768961866723 .sppb-flipbox-back.flip-box:before{\nbackground-color: rgba(5, 22, 70, 0.82);\n}</style></div></div><div class=\"sppb-addon-wrapper\" id=\"sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866720\"><div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sppb-addon-1768961866720\"><div class=\"sppb-addon sppb-addon-sppb-flibox flat_style flip_top flipon-hover\"><div class=\"sppb-flipbox-panel\"><div class=\"sppb-flipbox-front flip-box\"><div class=\"flip-box-inner\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa fa-question\" style=\"font-size:25px;background-color:#fff;display:inline-block;color:#007BF8;width:60px;height:60px;line-height:60px;border-radius: 50%;\"></i><h2>The Best Memory in the Animal Kingdom</h2>\n\nA) Dolphin\nB) Elephant\nC) Gorilla\nD) Horse</div></div><div class=\"sppb-flipbox-back flip-box\"><div class=\"flip-box-inner\"><h3>B) Elephant</h3>\n<p>Elephants are known for their remarkable memory. While pets may not remember every visit, keeping consistent medical records helps your veterinarian track health changes over time.</p></div></div></div></div><style type=\"text/css\">#sppb-addon-1768961866720{\nborder-radius: 0px;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866720{\nbox-shadow: 0 0 0 0 #ffffff;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866720{\nborder-radius: 0px;\n}#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866720{\nmargin-top: 0px;\nmargin-right: 0px;\nmargin-bottom: 30px;\nmargin-left: 0px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 1199.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866720{margin-top: 0px;\nmargin-right: 0px;\nmargin-bottom: 30px;\nmargin-left: 0px;}}\n@media (max-width: 991.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866720{margin-top: 0px;\nmargin-right: 0px;\nmargin-bottom: 30px;\nmargin-left: 0px;}}\n@media (max-width: 767.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866720{}}\n@media (max-width: 575.98px) {#sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866720{}}#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .sppb-addon-title{\n}</style><style type=\"text/css\">#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .sppb-addon-sppb-flibox{\ntext-align: center;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .sppb-flipbox-panel,#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .threeD-item{\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .sppb-flipbox-front,#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .threeD-flip-front{\ncolor: #fff;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .threeD-flip-front:before,#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .sppb-flipbox-front.flip-box:before{\nbackground-color: #051646;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .sppb-flipbox-back,#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .threeD-flip-back{\ncolor: #fff;\n}#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .threeD-flip-back:before,#sppb-addon-1768961866720 .sppb-flipbox-back.flip-box:before{\nbackground-color: rgba(5, 22, 70, 0.82);\n}</style></div></div><div class=\"sppb-addon-wrapper\" id=\"sppb-addon-wrapper-1768961866717\"><div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sppb-addon-1768961866717\"><div class=\"sppb-addon sppb-addon-sppb-flibox flat_style flip_top flipon-hover\"><div class=\"sppb-flipbox-panel\"><div class=\"sppb-f